'''Meowscarada''' (Japanese: '''マスカーニャ''' ''Masquernya'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

